  "cited_article_id": "schedule-recurring-visits",
  "reply": "When the system finds a conflict while creating a recurring series, it shows a conflict‑resolution prompt. Use that prompt to either skip the conflicting date, assign the visit to a covering provider, or manually pick a new time slot for that occurrence before saving the rest of the series. If the entire series fails to generate, check that the selected appointment type is allowed for recurring bookings under Settings > Appointment Types."
}
